# Aurum Gaming Platform: mandatory rules

## Scope protection
- Work ONLY inside `C:\Users\PC\Desktop\aurum-gaming-platform`.
- NEVER read, edit, scan, run commands in, move or delete any other project or folder
  (SkyX Chain, AI trading bot, HANNIBAL, SkyTrade Pro / SUSDT, or anything else on the Desktop
  or the computer) without the user's explicit permission in that same request.
- Every shell command must run with its working directory inside this project.
- System-level installs (for example PostgreSQL) are allowed only when they are required by this
  project; they must not touch other projects' data, configuration, ports or databases.

## Autonomy
- The user wants the agent to act on its own: inspect, build, run and test without asking
  for every small step.
- Ask first ONLY for: destructive actions, deployment, DNS/domain purchase, external
  paid or real-money integrations, and anything outside this folder.

## Communication
- Talk to the user in Arabic, short and clear. Code, file names and comments in English.
- Report real results only. Never claim a feature or test works unless it was actually run.

## Product rules (do not change without approval)
- Languages EN / FR / AR (RTL), configurable currencies, money as integer minor units.
- Players recharge and withdraw cash at physical shops only. No online withdrawal,
  bank transfer or crypto payout.
- Immutable ledger, idempotent operations, audit log, Super Admin created only by CLI.
- No fake integrations, no mock transactions. Demo data only behind SHOW_DEMO_DATA.
